  source_id "chronicle_1770581180617_3c4l7o"
  title "Where the Formation Breaks"
  summary "Deep Maw Krixizak and Krathund Gnurl the last surviving orca pair of their pod, are destroyed when Krath uses the Scared Shroud—a dangerous fire-knowledge artifact—to fuel the blood-working spell Grulkzul Omega Strike in hopes of regaining power and meaning. The spell consumes the pod-bond connecting them, scattering Krath's consciousness across the frozen deep while leaving Maw alone in the Still Pools, the sole survivor forced to continue their ritual of counting in silence."
